165	Table~\ref{tab:cross-scale} compares Qwen2.5-1.5B and 7B.
166	The 7B model yields $\AUC_{1v2} = 0.629$ versus $0.611$ for 1.5B ($\Delta = +1.7$pp, Welch $t$-test $p = 0.18$), a non-significant difference.
